<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of</p>
<p>the world fencing championships on Saturday.</p>
<p>Men's team sabre semifinals</p>
<p>France beat Hungary 45-37</p>
<p>Russia beat Italy 45-44</p>
<p>Third place playoff</p>
<p>Hungary beat Italy 45-34</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>France beat Russia 45-42</p>
<p>Women's team epee semifinals</p>
<p>Germany beat France 45-37</p>
<p>Hungary beat Estonia 45-24</p>
<p>Third place playoff</p>
<p>France beat Estonia 45-43</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Hungary beat Germany 45-40</p>
</text>
